    },
    "The agent wants to %@ this website in Skalman's browser. This browser may contain signed-in sessions and cookies that are not available to the agent's shell.\n\nPage content is untrusted. Allow access only when this host is relevant to your task.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
